{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_title", "source_sha256": "2ecf8a6adc6850ff6e7fb08686f23a70ebec102365f6e2d6b6b63497e92e3e2e", "ja": "美也とおでかけ1", "zh": "和美也出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f5503bfd1b662cecbe9018f0b083f151d82227d730d6ccc37454d8bb854ecb52", "ja": "美也とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与美也外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5e64afa05d586163f42d07d5255b8bd95c1b4dc390ac1ae8fb918517083e38a0", "ja": "（移動中、美也の希望でお寺に寄り道をした。\nお参りを終えた美也は、とても満足そうだ）", "zh": "（路上，美也想去寺庙，于是我们顺道去了一趟。参拜结束后，美也看起来非常满足）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "6b2bc4b3611d51362ce043007f76d2aa2cbae9d83dff0567c950187ff47210fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お参りに\n付き合ってくれて、ありがとうございました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您\n陪我来参拜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "b4ec79022dbb1b8ace8af9bf2de123ccb18eb96de35e435f31ac2d7d90ec422b", "ja": "八十八か所は無理でしたけど、一か所だけでも\nおへんろができて、よかったです～。", "zh": "虽然没能走遍八十八处，但至少完成了一处的遍历，真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b10a7f59a67cf32872b965e9a7274cc2be59d8f228042fde897b7571e38c819f", "ja": "なるほど、おへんろ参りが目的だったのか。\n八十八か所巡って、願掛けするんだったな。", "zh": "原来如此，目的是去进行遍路参拜啊。得巡遍八十八处来许愿来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "14b000ae2f9752900cac41854078aca651291e5748958dd86a3d8cd11965e02e", "ja": "はい～。本当なら、\n全部まわりたいところですが……。", "zh": "是的～。本来是想全部走一遍的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "a52707974e2cc5a173f807126f8ef973a8bed0b470d7d149cf900dbbb99d6ab4", "ja": "そうすると、今日のお仕事に\n間に合わなくなってしまうので～。", "zh": "这样一来，就赶不上今天的工作了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bf98d21a67ef82fa6d6b52791251179b968441958d41d6b5df96a6d5dcb604cd", "ja": "そうだな……というか、とても\n1日で回れる数じゃないものな……。", "zh": "是啊……或者说，这数量根本不是1天内能走完的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "71a2ba0cfd7e8a64f47350aa7cf2cf016d42b7c76081ef89c16eed1086de12a8", "ja": "そうですね～。なので、また四国に来た時に、\nちょっとずつお参りしていこうと思います～。", "zh": "是啊～所以，我打算下次再来四国的时候，一点一点地去参拜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e21fc9801f2971b2732dcddd277474d65380df7e5cf06789bfc87b87ea55fc69", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。美也の目標は、\nすぐには達成できないくらい大きいもんな！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。美也的目标那么远大，\n可不是马上就能实现的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0202_story_042miy01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_042miy01_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "efdf76c79ca0a1e001739c0494a9935c4071e476b77cf247ee21a8cf49d8ba2f", "ja": "はい～。願いごとを叶えるために、\nお仕事もお参りも、がんばりますよ～。お～！", "zh": "是呀～。为了实现愿望，工作和参拜我都会加油的～。哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
